Generated tier. Every codebase.*.md leaf and every Contents row of .index.md is written by
codebase.py: never hand-edit them; fix the generator or the source and regenerate. The prose
above the Contents table, .tags and this file are authored.

Regenerate when the change that moved the source lands, never for an unmerged branch, from
the directory this command was first run in:

    python modules/codebase/codebase.py --repo examples/winchbook --into examples/edgewing/public/products/Winchbook/codebase --profile examples/winchbook/codebase.profile.json

Add --check to report drift without writing; the _generated:_ line never counts as drift.
